t: Irreversible&#10;thermochromic materials change&#10;color when heated but do not&#10;return to their original color&#10;when cooled. This property enables&#10;the permanent storage of&#10;temperature h..." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#d9eaf7;strokeColor=#5b9bd5;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1480" y="1516" width="250" height="436" /></mxCell><mxCell id="graph_paper_5_3" value="Studies of the Morphology of&#10;Hematite Synthesized from Waste&#10;Iron Sulfate&#10;year: 2024&#10;paper_id:&#10;https://openalex.org/W4401015602&#10;direction: forward&#10;foundational: False&#10;pred_count: 1&#10;evidence_score: 0.78&#10;keywords:&#10;idea: Problem: The paper addresses&#10;the need to convert waste iron&#10;sulfate into valuable hema...;&#10;Existing Methods: Existing pigment&#10;synthesis approaches often rely on&#10;conventional heating, vir...&#10;abstract: Microwave-based&#10;reactions have gained traction in&#10;recent years due to their ability&#10;to enhance reaction rates and&#10;yield while reducing energy&#10;consumption. Also, according to&#10;the..." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#d9eaf7;strokeColor=#5b9bd5;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1480" y="1976" width="250" height="452" /></mxCell><mxCell id="graph_paper_5_4" value="Cr3+-doped LaAlO3 red pigments&#10;with enhanced near-infrared&#10;reflectance for energy-efficient&#10;coatings&#10;year: 2025&#10;paper_id:&#10;https://openalex.org/W4412979450&#10;direction: forward&#10;foundational: False&#10;pred_count: 2&#10;evidence_score: 0.9&#10;keywords:&#10;idea: Problem: Red pigments used&#10;in coatings often absorb near-&#10;infrared radiation, leading t...;&#10;Existing Methods: Conventional red&#10;pigments such as iron oxides,&#10;organic dyes, or complex inorg...&#10;abstract:" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#d9eaf7;strokeColor=#5b9bd5;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1480" y="2452" width="250" height="340" /></mxCell><mxCell id="graph_edge_1" value="parallel_pred" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=0;jettySize=0;html=0;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="graph_paper_3_2" target="graph_seed"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="graph_edge_2" value="explicit_pred" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=0;jettySize=0;html=0;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="graph_paper_3_1" target="graph_seed"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="graph_edge_3" value="direct_to_seed" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=0;jettySize=0;html=0;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="graph_paper_1_3" target="graph_seed"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="graph_edge_4" value="direct_to_seed" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=0;jettySize=0;html=0;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="graph_paper_1_1" target="graph_seed_1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="graph_edge_5" value="explicit_pred" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=0;jettySize=0;html=0;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="graph_paper_4_4" target="graph_seed_2"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="graph_edge_6" value="direct_to_seed" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=0;jettySize=0;html=0;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="graph_paper_1_2" target="graph_seed_2"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="graph_edge_7" value="direct_to_seed" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=0;jettySize=0;html=0;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#555555