;Abstract: N/A&#10;&#10;16. A third blind test of crystal structure prediction&#10;(2005) [score=0.5251]&#10;Abstract: Following the interest generated by two previous&#10;blind tests of crystal structure prediction (CSP1999 and&#10;CSP2001), a third such collaborative project (CSP2004) was&#10;hosted by the Cambridge Crystallographic Data Centre. A&#10;range of methodologies used in searching for and&#10;ranking...&#10;&#10;17. High-throughput screening of inorganic compounds for&#10;the discovery of novel dielectric and optical materials&#10;(2017) [score=0.5227]&#10;Abstract: Dielectrics are an important class of materials&#10;that are ubiquitous in modern electronic applications.&#10;Even though their properties are important for the&#10;performance of devices, the number of compounds with known&#10;dielectric constant is on the order of a few hundred.&#10;Here, we u...&#10;&#10;18. Identifying Crystal Structures Beyond Known Prototypes&#10;from X-ray Powder Diffraction Spectra (2023)&#10;[score=0.5201]&#10;Abstract: The large amount of powder diffraction data for&#10;which the corresponding crystal structures have not yet&#10;been identified suggests the existence of numerous&#10;undiscovered, physically relevant crystal structure&#10;prototypes. In this paper, we present a scheme to resolve&#10;powder diffr..." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2400" y="340" width="442" height="3642" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge_event_1" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=0;jettySize=0;html=0;dashed=1;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="step_step1" target="retrieval_1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="retrieval_2" value="Retrieval 2&#10;step: step1&#10;command: openalex&#10;cache_hit: False&#10;paper_count: 47&#10;&#10;Parameters&#10;source: openalex&#10;query: combinatorial explorati