l properties (2022)&#10;Abstract: ), each of which can then influence how a&#10;material interacts with light, playing a large role in&#10;dictating the photophysical and sometimes photochemical&#10;properties. In this perspective, we summarize the progress&#10;that our group and others have made, showing how oxidation&#10;of a s..." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2400" y="25644" width="442" height="8178" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge_event_6" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=0;jettySize=0;html=0;dashed=1;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="step_step1" target="retrieval_6"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="retrieval_7" value="Retrieval 7&#10;step: step1&#10;command: search-papers&#10;cache_hit: False&#10;paper_count: 18&#10;&#10;Parameters&#10;query_text: high-throughput experimental search for new&#10;inorganic color pigments&#10;keywords: [{'text': 'high throughput', 'score': 10},&#10;{'text': 'throughput experimental', 'score': 9}, {'text':&#10;'experimental search', 'score': 8}, {'text': 'search new',&#10;'score': 7}, {'text': 'new inorganic', 'score': 6}]&#10;source_type: idea_text&#10;top_k: 18&#10;retrieval_mode: hybrid&#10;target_field: Chemistry&#10;&#10;Returned Papers&#10;1. Artificial yellow pigments: production and&#10;characterization through spectroscopic methods of analysis&#10;(2010) [score=0.6954]&#10;Abstract: Artificial yellow pigments (lead-tin yellow type&#10;I and type II,\nlead antimonate yellow and lead-tin-&#10;antimony yellow) have\nbeen produced, starting from&#10;various recipes and from pure\nchemicals, in different&#10;experimental conditions. The products\nwere analysed using&#10;micro-Rama...&#10;&#10;2. Design, Synthesis, and Application of Colored Cobalt&#10;Pigments (Pink, Blue, Green) (2020) [score=0.6909]&#10;Abstract: The combinatio